<title>USA: Riverside Hospital, Calif., $41 mln deal repriced.</title>
<headline>Riverside Hospital, Calif., $41 mln deal repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Thursday it repriced County of Riverside Asset Leasing Corp's $41.2 million Riverside Hospital project bond deal, lowering yields.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>COUNTY OF RIVERSIDE ASSET LEASING CORPORATION</p>
<p>RE: $41,203,098.10*</p>
<p>LEASEHOLD REVENUE BONDS, 1997 SERIES A</p>
<p>(COUNTY OF RIVERSIDE HOSPITAL PROJECT)</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>NOTE THE REPRICING AND RESTRUCTURING.</p>
<p>  MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA		   FITCH: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>DUE: 06/01</p>
<p>DATED (zeros): Date of Delivery</p>
<p>								  APPROX.</p>
<p>								DOLLAR PRICE</p>
